DESCRIPTION:📚 BETWEEN THE PAGES\nA Synergy Book Swap\nGot books on your 
 shelf that you’ve loved\, finished\, or are simply ready to pass along? 
 Bring them to Synergy and let them find their next reader.\nJoin us Sunday
 \, December 6 at 3 PM for a FREE afternoon of books\, games\, laughs\, and
  a little friendly competition.\nBring up to 5 gently used books in good c
 ondition to add to our swap. Then we’ll play a few fun games to determin
 e picking order as we make our way through the books. So this won’t be a
  free-for-all around a table. Everyone will get their turn to browse\, cho
 ose\, and hopefully discover something they wouldn’t have picked up othe
 rwise.\nAll kinds of books are welcome: fiction\, fantasy\, romance\, myst
 ery\, horror\, spirituality\, witchcraft\, mythology\, self-development\, 
 poetry\, memoirs\, and more.\n📚 Bring 1–5 books\n🎲 We’ll play ga
 mes to determine picking order\n📖 Choose new-to-you books to take home\
 n✨ All genres welcome\n🤎 Completely FREE\nCome hang out\, meet other 
 readers\, play with us\, and give a few old books a brand-new chapter.\nSu
 nday\, December 6 • 3 PM\n📍 Synergy Metaphysical Shop\nFREE\nBring bo
 oks you’ve loved. Leave with something new to love.\n\nhttps://happening
 next.com/event/between-the-pages-eid3a0e6736r2
